    Game: NUKE! Build and Battle (Roblox)
    Framework: Rayfield UI Library

    Fix iteration 6 — Cobalt-confirmed architecture:
    - StampAsset signature: InvokeServer(assetId, CFrame, uuid, {}, rotationIndex)
    - Server IGNORES the CFrame rotation matrix. Rotation is applied server-side
      from the integer rotationIndex (0=default, 1=90° CCW, 2=180°, 3=270°).
    - Position is raw world space. Translation = srcPivot→myPivot delta applied
      to each block's world-space PlacementCFrame position.
    - rotationIndex read from model's "Rotation" IntValue child (or 0 if absent).
    - BFS connectivity retained: floor seeded, blocks only stamp when a 6-face
      neighbor cell is already occupied. Handles non-4x4 blocks correctly because
      we no longer fight the server's own rotation system.
    ================================================================================
]]

